  "status": "published",
  "is_featured": true
}
### Get course with ID 6
GET http://localhost:3000/courses/details/2
### GET course
GET http://localhost:3000/courses

### Course search base on word
GET http://localhost:3000/courses/search?search=ielts

### Course search - error
GET http://localhost:3000/courses/search?page=0

### Filter - skill only
GET http://localhost:3000/courses/search?skill=reading

### Band filter - listening 5.5
GET http://localhost:3000/courses/search?skill=listening&band=5.5

### Band filter - reading 6
GET http://localhost:3000/courses/search?skill=reading&band=6

### Band filter - error: band without skill
GET http://localhost:3000/courses/search?band=6

### Band filter - error: wrong step
GET http://localhost:3000/courses/search?skill=listening&band=6.3
